<article class="ltx_document">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Enhancing Multi-Modal LLMs Reasoning via 
<br class="ltx_break">Difficulty-Aware Group Normalization</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
